    "name": "The Hobo Complex",
    "steam_appid": 3524510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524510/extras/6d6b1c5ded1b75f5557ceb0e68dfca70.avif?t=1740760329\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hobo Complex</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game exploring drug addiction, homelessness, and the circumstances that led to it. Wander through eerie, atmospheric environments as you search for your girlfriend, who left after a heated argument.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2>You and your girlfriend have gotten into a fight about a new position at your job. Because of this she left and also took your dog with her, leaving you all alone. Home does not feel like home anymore.. It is too quiet and there are too many memories. One night, you wake up by muffled noises just outside your front door, could this be her? This moment marks the beginning of a journey that brings you closer to finding your girlfriend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524510/extras/5b14699db76c71bb07bf83e8b4474024.avif?t=1740760329\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>Classic survival horror gameplay with emphasis on exploration</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern first person controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low poly PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story that can be completed in about an hour</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524510/extras/6d6b1c5ded1b75f5557ceb0e68dfca70.avif?t=1740760329\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hobo Complex</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game exploring drug addiction, homelessness, and the circumstances that led to it. Wander through eerie, atmospheric environments as you search for your girlfriend, who left after a heated argument.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2>You and your girlfriend have gotten into a fight about a new position at your job. Because of this she left and also took your dog with her, leaving you all alone. Home does not feel like home anymore.. It is too quiet and there are too many memories. One night, you wake up by muffled noises just outside your front door, could this be her? This moment marks the beginning of a journey that brings you closer to finding your girlfriend.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524510/extras/5b14699db76c71bb07bf83e8b4474024.avif?t=1740760329\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>Classic survival horror gameplay with emphasis on exploration</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern first person controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low poly PS1 aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compelling story that can be completed in about an hour</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Hobo Complex is a first-person psychological horror game delving into drug addiction, homelessness and the reasons that might have caused it. Traverse varied, eerie settings while uncovering the truth behind where your girlfriend went after leaving you.",
